<p>Chain multiple pipes together:</p>

<p>Original: [{$rawText}]</p>
<p>Trimmed and uppercase: [{pad:echo $rawText | trim | upper/}]</p>

<p>Original: {$message}</p>
<p>Uppercase first letter of each word: {pad:echo $message | ucwords/}</p>
<p>Replace and uppercase: {pad:echo $message | replace('fox', 'dog') | ucwords/}</p>
